  m_Name: Type 1 AP Shell Ballistics Profile
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  description: Type 1 AP / Type 1 APC is the historical/improved Japanese 460 mm
    AP/APC shell for the Yamato-class main battery. Compared with Type 91, it is
    modeled as the improved AP role with stronger cap attachment and shell-dye
    identification use. It uses the same agreed AP dispersion ellipse and shared
    AP flight-time table as Type 91 AP.
